Blue Pine Solutions Mail
========================

Blue Pine Solutions Mail is a modified, downstream version of Mailflare.
It is distributed by Blue Pine Solutions.

Upstream project
----------------
Mailflare - Email for professionals and teams
https://github.com/hieunc229/mailflare
