Corresponding Source
--------------------
The Corresponding Source for Blue Pine Solutions Mail is available at:
https://github.com/blue-pine-solutions/blue-pine-mail

A running installation offers its source from the "Source" link in the
application (the /source address). When the build records its commit
(BLUEPINE_BUILD_COMMIT), that link points to the exact commit of the
running build; otherwise it points to the repository above.

